                        "glosses": [
                            "A space incorrectly dividing a compound word."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "derogatory",
                            "neuter",
                            "strong"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "361d4874-678e-46b6-aed9-f06f66d09478",
                                "sense_id": "e01d9d54-2458-3446-9fcc-671ede7969a7",
                                "text": "Das Hamburger Pressehaus heißt nicht mehr Pressehaus, seit vergangener Woche heißt es \"Helmut Schmidt Haus\". Unser verstorbener Herausgeber hätte[…] wahrscheinlich nur die Schultern gezuckt, womöglich auch darüber, dass das Eingangsportal ausgerechnet zur ZEIT-Redaktion nun Deppenleerzeichen schmücken.",
                                "translation": "The Hamburg Presshouse is no longer called \"Presshouse\"; since last week, it's been renamed \"Helmut Schmidt House\". Our late editor […] would probably have just shrugged his shoulders, perhaps also at the fact that the entrance to the ZEIT editorial office is now adorned with idiotsspaces.",
                                "english": "The Hamburg Presshouse is no longer called \"Presshouse\"; since last week, it's been renamed \"Helmut Schmidt House\". Our late editor […] would probably have just shrugged his shoulders, perhaps also at the fact that the entrance to the ZEIT editorial office is now adorned with idiotsspaces."
                            }
                        ]
